WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Checking a family PNR? Don’t stop at the first passenger.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
In this fictional example, one row says CNF and another says WL.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Read each current status separately,

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
then verify the applicable travel conditions through the official booking service.

5
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
A prediction for the booking is not a guaranteed berth for everyone.

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Keep your ticket details private when asking for help.

